# DraftIQ — environment variables
#
# The app works fully with NO keys set: the player board and "suggest my next
# pick" run on the live Sleeper player pool + a built-in full-PPR value engine.
#
# These are OPTIONAL upgrades. Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the
# values you need.

# --- Optional: real LLM for richer draft reasoning ---
# Set any one of these to enable an LLM-backed "suggest my next pick".
# Uses an OpenAI-compatible /chat/completions endpoint.
# AI_API_KEY=
# AI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# AI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1

# --- Optional: enable live expert ADP/rankings (ESPN) ---
# By default the board uses the built-in value model. ESPN rankings are
# attempted automatically; set this to force them off if they cause issues.
# ESPN_RANKINGS=false

# --- Project (usually fine to leave defaults) ---
# NODE_ENV=development
